{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29e86e32198bbdca2d5f5510eed9090e04a522976c24a8ef2849bdb4036595ec", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影のため、\n歩にスーツを着てもらっている）", "zh": "（今天为了拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》，让步穿上了西装）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0239c0802c9dfdac1948b1c441e8d6fd79aee1d2e0534b8754c95941c8531793", "ja": "へへっ、どう？　{$P$}。\nアタシのスーツ姿、けっこういい感じだと思わない？", "zh": "嘿嘿，怎么样？{$P$}。\n你不觉得我穿西装的样子挺帅气的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3a31b5e4f036742411f8202136528eae301f8371742293d9210b58670d9a607f", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるよ。\nスーツ姿の歩、なんだか新鮮だな。", "zh": "嗯，很适合你哦。\n穿正装的步，感觉挺新鲜的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1de1272a589cf7978492a4db8c528f1749f695e93cfac3c735690b239ddd50f5", "ja": "アタシもそう思うけど……ま、いちおう学生だし。\nスーツぐらい、ちゃんと着こなせないとね！", "zh": "我也这么觉得……不过，毕竟我还是学生嘛。\n至少得把西装穿得像样才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ebed47ee68de350fcc67625da5e77e3933248678376f48a69dcb37af0ff61d0", "ja": "そうだ！　写真を撮って、\n大学の友達にも見せてみようかな？　へへ♪", "zh": "对了！要不要拍张照片，也给大学里的朋友们看看？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dc67968c2483cf372b58f3869c77965458a19eca7d6920ff06a523293793c774", "ja": "スーツ着て学校行ったことなんてないし、\nみんな、ビックリするかもしれないよね！？", "zh": "我还从来没穿过西装去学校，说不定大家都会吓一跳呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ece2a84791ee3020d830856187aaa8e46a4c86b551122f0758094a68d4659474", "ja": "友達に送るなら、撮ってあげようか？", "zh": "要是要发给朋友，我帮你拍一张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76fbe12e82af8b69d85e565cdb78ba8161a6f337e381f8cad7acfbc892502c20", "ja": "やった♪　ありがとう、{$P$}！\nそれじゃ、いかにも大学生っぽく、真面目そうに……。", "zh": "太好了♪谢谢你，{$P$}！\n那么，就拍得像个十足的大学生，显得认真一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1008_se", "source_sha256": "95e8c2beca06a3d182e073f390f7369ff8385339c25d6e5b5e5b43a4204baaef", "ja": "カシャッ！", "zh": "咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f0305ec9eddabceefc862362ebb420b32f8e1c41ae0f05cfb7ca07fc816a8d08", "ja": "うん、いい感じに撮れたぞ！", "zh": "嗯，拍得很不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cdf9eee63fb0542933d7502c3adf37428bc54415a27ddbbbd3fd9f433f8e8238", "ja": "サンキュー！　それじゃ、さっそく送ってみよっと。\nみんな、どんな反応するかな～？", "zh": "谢谢！那我马上发出去吧。\n大家会有什么反应呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1011_se", "source_sha256": "214a78af29fce46a93824787bc526f1914d664420831216fe07eb950c3b59231", "ja": "ピロ～ン♪", "zh": "叮咚～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "962a77a8b9b176152827bdbe6be2560db617e2320c78a311d8844304518437f9", "ja": "わ、もう返ってきた！\nさてさて、どんな感想が……って、ええっ！？", "zh": "哇，已经回复了！\n让我看看，会是什么感想……诶诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ce2dde627edf7a75aa22f439c619628dbc5d755d542e3f4af3d9daa9b394225d", "ja": "どうした？\n友達、何て言ってきたんだ？", "zh": "怎么了？\n你朋友怎么说的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ca42f411b4d98f37bc4ac3d7ad30f08d00e7dabeb6f9bdc3bc2787bfce2cb5c", "ja": "あ、あはは……それがさ、スーツ着てるせいか、\n「まさか就活！？　アイドル辞めるの？」だって……。", "zh": "啊，啊哈哈……可能是因为穿着西装吧，\n他们居然说：“难道是在找工作！？你要退出偶像活动了吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2ae0a4bf203d256dca6415efea9893bf99b03d3d1e85c40cbe06fe78febbe59f", "ja": "マイガー！\nもうっ、就活じゃないのに～～～！", "zh": "天啊！\n真是的，明明不是在找工作～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1016_se", "source_sha256": "214a78af29fce46a93824787bc526f1914d664420831216fe07eb950c3b59231", "ja": "ピロ～ン♪", "zh": "叮咚～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a019d859571904918ad02a6efe55f510ca443d5c0f0b0a5e2988bc3051caeb12", "ja": "わ、また来た！　「就活なんかしちゃダメ！」\n「アイドルじゃない歩なんて、歩じゃない！」……。", "zh": "哇，又来了！“不许去找工作什么的！”  \n“不是偶像的步，就不是步！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5cfb8237c071ec2a20d995170a6cc58e94c671ab43a7556a2dba9bffe0350c64", "ja": "「ナンバーワン目指すんでしょ！」\n「悩みがあるなら、聞くから！」……。", "zh": "“你不是还要当第一名吗！”\n“要是有烦恼的话，我会听你说的！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "364f34c8c742135055993627c332c687f3cc91475be48658ed6b04fcebfe6d0f", "ja": "そうか……。\nいい友達がたくさんいるんだな、歩。", "zh": "这样啊……\n你有这么多好朋友呢，步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "77e7ed5a3959ebd0050429545eba858c0da0f752035731e3105847540acf7f89", "ja": "{$P$}……へへっ、そうなんだ！\nアタシの友達、みんないいヤツでしょ？", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿，是啊！\n我的朋友们，都是很棒的家伙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8219ae61155b201db72ee7f92c53cd892caa390bc16fb50f6055643136956dea", "ja": "あのさ、もう一回撮ってもらってもいいかな？\n次は、めちゃくちゃカッコイイポーズ決めるから！", "zh": "那个……能再帮我拍一次吗？\n这次我会摆出超级帅气的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0183_1022_p", "source_sha256": "15a488b8490b841abc65baaf02b9d6b58bd9f236059e973ded64f6b0fdeb0252", "ja": "（この出来事が良い刺激になったのか、歩は本番の\n撮影も、一発で決めてみせた。流石だな、歩！）", "zh": "不知道是不是这件事给了步很好的刺激，她连正式拍摄也一遍就完成了。真不愧是步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
